            <ArticleTitle>Fentanyl nasal spray (Lazanda) for pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>99-100</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The FDA has approved a nasal spray formulation of fentanyl (Lazanda-Archimedes) for management of breakthrough pain in adult cancer patients who are already receiving and are tolerant to opioid therapy. Fentanyl is already available in the US for intravenous, intrathecal, epidural, transdermal and oral transmucosal use.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
